    const description = `The Starry Night by Vincent van Gogh is a swirling masterpiece of ${centroids.map(c => `#${rgbToHex(c)}`).join(', ')}, depicting a tumultuous night sky above a peaceful village. The thick brushstrokes and bold colors suggest the artist's emotional state was one of intense passion and creativity. The painting is believed to represent the artist's inner turmoil and desire for spiritual connection with the universe.`;
    document.getElementById("description").innerHTML = description;
  };
  img.src = 'starry-night.jpg';
  function rgbToHex(rgb) {
    return rgb.map(c => c.toString(16).padStart(2, '0')).join('');
  }
</script>
<div id="description"></div>
```
In this modified code, we first convert the pixel data into an array of RGB values and use the KMeans algorithm to group similar colors together. We then use the centroids of these clusters to generate a written description of the painting's color palette. Finally, we add a description of the artist's emotional state based on the painting's brush strokes and bold colors.

